<Section id="hobbies" title="Hobbies">
  <p>
    <strong><u>Sports</u></strong>: 
    I play padel and disc golf, and I competed in table tennis for 8 years.
    I also enjoy trying out new sports -- let me know if you have some cool suggestions!
    I was lucky to be a Press Volunteer at the curling event of the 2026 Winter Olympics.
  </p>

  <p>
    <strong><u>Languages</u></strong>: 
    I love learning languages, and understanding the cultural impact of language in general.
    I am fluent in Hungarian and English, and always eager to improve my knowledge of (Swiss) German, Romanian, and Bislama.
    I am one of team leaders of the Hungarian team at the <a href="https://ioling.org/">International Linguistics Olympiad</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    <strong><u>Music</u></strong>: 
    I am a drummer in a rock band, while also trying to improve my piano improvisation skills.
  </p>

